ifest.json u tien un \'build_no\' invalido.','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'O campo \'server_build_id\' de manifest.json no ye un ID de compilación valido.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'O campo \'contract\' de manifest.json no ye una cadena de versión valida.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'O campo \'status\' de manifest.json ha d\'estar \'published\'.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'O campo \'kind\' de manifest.json ha d\'estar \'plugin\' u \'theme\'.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json tien un \'default_domain_entries\' no valido.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json tien un \'default_domain_files\' no valido.','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest no tien o campo \'%s\' u ye invalido.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'O campo \'server_build_id\' d\'expected_manifest no ye un ID de compilación valido.','No record for %s'=>'No bi ha cap rechistro de %s','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'Un u más fichers servius ya no coinciden con o manifiesto.','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'No bi ha garra compilación anterior á la que tornar.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'No s\'ha puesto rechistrar o cambio en l\'índice de traducions; tornar a intentar-lo.','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Tipo desconoixito: %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Dominio no seguro: %s','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'O dominio de texto \'%1$s\' (%2$s) ya se sirve ta atro componente instalau (%3$s); no s\'ha instalau cosa.','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'Revertir sobrescribiría \'%1